{"id": "boolq/test/53", "source": "boolq", "primitive": "noul", "split": "test", "state": "{\"passage\": \"The ASU includes a midnight blue coat and low waist trousers for male soldiers; and a midnight blue coat, slacks and skirt for female soldiers. The fabric for the ASU is heavier and more wrinkle resistant than previously manufactured uniforms and will consist of 55% wool and 45% polyester material. The ASU coat has a tailored, athletic cut to improve uniform fit and appearance. The ASU includes an improved heavier and wrinkle resistant short and long-sleeved white shirt with permanent military creases and shoulder loops. The JROTC version replaces the white shirt with the prototype grey shirt and gold braid is not worn on the blue trousers or on the sleeves of the class A coat. Compared to the Army's previous uniforms, the ASU does not include a garrison cap; soldiers will continue to wear the Army's berets.\", \"question\": \"can you wear short sleeve shirt with asu jacket\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"noul\", \"instructions\": \"Based only on `passage`, is the answer to `question` yes?\"}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"google/boolq\", \"license\": \"cc-by-sa-3.0\", \"domain\": \"reading-comprehension\", \"task_family\": \"grounded-yes-no\", \"hf_config\": \"default\"}"}
{"id": "boolq/test/1497", "source": "boolq", "primitive": "noul", "split": "test", "state": "{\"passage\": \"The Nobel Peace Prize (Swedish, Norwegian: Nobels fredspris) is one of the five Nobel Prizes created by the Swedish industrialist, inventor, and armaments manufacturer Alfred Nobel, along with the prizes in Chemistry, Physics, Physiology or Medicine, and Literature. Since March 1901, it has been awarded annually (with some exceptions) to those who have ``done the most or the best work for fraternity between nations, for the abolition or reduction of standing armies and for the holding and promotion of peace congresses''.\", \"question\": \"is the nobel peace prize awarded every year\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"noul\", \"instructions\": \"Based only on `passage`, is the answer to `question` yes?\"}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"google/boolq\", \"license\": \"cc-by-sa-3.0\", \"domain\": \"reading-comprehension\", \"task_family\": \"grounded-yes-no\", \"hf_config\": \"default\"}"}
{"id": "boolq/test/3131", "source": "boolq", "primitive": "noul", "split": "test", "state": "{\"passage\": \"The Kissing Booth is a 2018 American romantic comedy film directed by Vince Marcello, based on the novel of the same name by Beth Reekles. It stars Molly Ringwald, Joey King, Jacob Elordi and Joel Courtney. The film was released on May 11, 2018 on Netflix.\", \"question\": \"is the movie the kissing booth on netflix\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"noul\", \"instructions\": \"Based only on `passage`, is the answer to `question` yes?\"}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"google/boolq\", \"license\": \"cc-by-sa-3.0\", \"domain\": \"reading-comprehension\", \"task_family\": \"grounded-yes-no\", \"hf_config\": \"default\"}"}
{"id": "boolq/test/1754", "source": "boolq", "primitive": "noul", "split": "test", "state": "{\"passage\": \"Causality (also referred to as causation, or cause and effect) is what connects one process (the cause) with another process or state (the effect), where the first is partly responsible for the second, and the second is partly dependent on the first. In general, a process has many causes, which are said to be causal factors for it, and all lie in its past. An effect can in turn be a cause of, or causal factor for, many other effects, which all lie in its future. Causality is metaphysically prior to notions of time and space.\", \"question\": \"is it necessary that there is a cause before an effect\"}", "question": "{\"type\": \"noul\", \"instructions\": \"Based only on `passage`, is the answer to `question` yes?\"}", "label": "1", "soft_label": null, "meta": "{\"hf_id\": \"google/boolq\", \"license\": \"cc-by-sa-3.0\", \"domain\": \"reading-comprehension\", \"task_family\": \"grounded-yes-no\", \"hf_config\": \"default\"}"}
